Z||000002||BAM-BAM||04-21-2001||07:35 PM|||| Those look sweet!! Wheels are the hardest things to decide on. There are so many out there that look awesome it scrambles your brain. Kind of like trying to find the right cologne or perfume, after a while they all seem to blend. Hey! That's it! We need to come together to design and produce the perfect Americam Muscle Fiero wheel. I get to ggo first. It should come in several different finishes, Be either 17" or 18"x 7.5" to 8" The lugs should be covered with a completely indiginous locking system, should also have the deepest offset that niether scrubs or hangs out more than 10mm beyond the wheel well (flush would be perfect) with standars lowering(Eibach). The spoke design shall be indiginoud to the Fiero only. Ok, now my minds eye has several wheel center designs, but I'm interested in what other have to say. Come on y'all lets do this  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">. We can call them PFF Wheels. Who knows if it worked we could move over to other markets. One imparative, they must be affordable.<P>Peace, B2 OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Knowledge is POWER!<BR>That is why the ignorant remain Weak!||||reg||6
